{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "两张面孔",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 104.32,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "交易所同时扮演两个角色。",
   "spoken": "交易所同时扮演两个决色。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 5.33
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "一个是保管者，替用户保管私钥和资产，这叫托管。",
   "spoken": "一个是保管者，替用户保管私钥和资产，这叫托管。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 5.72,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 5.816,
   "speechEnd": 10.986
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "另一个是检查站，链上的资金，从这里进出法币世界。",
   "spoken": "另一个是检查站，链上的资金，从这里进出法币世界。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 11.38,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 11.471,
   "speechEnd": 15.889
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "保管者失误，用户丢钱。",
   "spoken": "保管者失误，用户丢钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 16.32,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 16.32,
   "speechEnd": 18.615
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "检查站失误，赃款被洗白，交易所自己也要承担法律责任。",
   "spoken": "检查站失误，赃款被洗白，交易所自己也要承担法律责任。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 19.02,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 19.02,
   "speechEnd": 24.137
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，交易所像一座机场。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，交易所像一座机场。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 24.52,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 24.615,
   "speechEnd": 27.209
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "金库是冷钱包，要防盗。",
   "spoken": "金库是冷钱包，要防盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 27.62,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 27.715,
   "speechEnd": 29.764
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "登机口是提币，要验票，入境口是充值，要验真伪。",
   "spoken": "登机口是提币，要验票，入境口是充值，要验真伪。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 30.24,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 30.335,
   "speechEnd": 35.482
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "安检是反洗钱，边检是制裁筛查，拦住名单上的人。",
   "spoken": "安检是反洗钱，边检是制裁筛查，拦住名单上的人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 35.9,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 35.994,
   "speechEnd": 41.117
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，机场的旅客，走了就走了。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，机场的旅客，走了就走了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 41.56,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 41.658,
   "speechEnd": 45.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "链上的资金流向永久公开，执法机构几年以后，还能回头追查每一笔。",
   "spoken": "链上的资金流向永久公开，执法机构几年以后，还能回头追查每一笔。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 45.54,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 45.54,
   "speechEnd": 51.043
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "先看保管者这一面，钱在交易所里怎么流动。",
   "spoken": "先看保管者这一面，钱在交易所里怎么流动。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 51.44,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 51.44,
   "speechEnd": 55.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "每个用户有自己的充值地址，钱到了，被归集到热钱包。",
   "spoken": "每个用户有自己的充值地址，钱到了，被归集到热钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 55.66,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 55.758,
   "speechEnd": 60.396
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "热钱包负责日常提币，余额超出水位，多出来的转回冷钱包。",
   "spoken": "热钱包负责日常提币，余额超出水位，多出来的转回冷钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 60.76,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 60.853,
   "speechEnd": 65.573
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "冷钱包补充温钱包，温钱包再补充热钱包。",
   "spoken": "冷钱包补充温钱包，温钱包再补充热钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 66.02,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 66.119,
   "speechEnd": 69.824
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "链下还有一条流水线。",
   "spoken": "链下还有一条流水线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 70.24,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 70.24,
   "speechEnd": 71.991
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "充值扫描服务读取链上数据，记进内部账本。",
   "spoken": "充值扫描服务读取链上数据，记进内部账本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 72.38,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 72.38,
   "speechEnd": 76.518
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "提币请求从账本出发，经过风控引擎，再到签名服务，最后从热钱包发出。",
   "spoken": "提币请求从账本出发，经过风控引擎，再到签名服务，最后从热钱包发出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 76.92,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 77.02,
   "speechEnd": 84.753
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "攻击打在四个点上。",
   "spoken": "攻击打在四个点上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 85.22,
   "dur": 1.68,
   "speechStart": 85.319,
   "speechEnd": 86.692
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "充值扫描，被假充值骗过。",
   "spoken": "充值扫描，被假充值骗过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 87.12,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 87.213,
   "speechEnd": 89.232
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "账本，被盗来的用户账号拿去提币。",
   "spoken": "账本，被盗来的用户账号拿去提币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 89.66,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 89.759,
   "speechEnd": 92.401
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "签名服务，被伪造的上游请求驱动。",
   "spoken": "签名服务，被伪造的上游请求驱动。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-22.wav",
   "start": 92.84,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 92.934,
   "speechEnd": 95.912
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "热钱包，私钥泄露。",
   "spoken": "热钱包，私钥泄露。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-23.wav",
   "start": 96.34,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 96.34,
   "speechEnd": 98.193
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "图里没画的还有内部人，他可以同时出现在这四个点上。",
   "spoken": "图里没画的还有内部人，他可以同时出现在这四个点上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg2-24.wav",
   "start": 98.64,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 98.735,
   "speechEnd": 102.944
  }
